  "title": "January 30, 2018",
  "authors_raw": "KNOT HOMOLOGY AND SHEAVES ON THE HILBERT SCHEME OF POINTS ON",
  "title_lines": [
   "January 30, 2018"
  ],
  "abstract": "For each braid \u03b2 \u2208 Brn we construct a 2-periodic complex S\u03b2 of quasi-coherent C\u2217 \u00d7 C\u2217 - equivariant sheaves on the non-commutative nested Hilbert scheme Hilb f ree 1,n . W e show that the triply graded vector space of the hypercohomology H(S\u03b2 \u2297 \u2227 \u2022 (B)) with B being tautological vector bundle, is an isotopy invariant of the knot obtained by the closure of \u03b2 . W e also show that the support of cohomology of the complex S\u03b2 is supported on the ordinary nested Hilbert scheme Hilb 1,n \u2282 Hilbf ree 1,n , that allows us to relate the triply graded knot homology to the sheaves on Hilb 1,n",
  "docinfo": {
